---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";

const title = "隐私声明";
---

<Layout title={title}>
  <div class="mywords">
    <h2>{title}</h2>
    <p>
      本网站为静态网站，且 mcenahle 已经关闭 Cloudflare Web Analytics
      功能，也不存在所谓的 Cookie。旨在让访客只看信息。即看即走。
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not eat cookies. We eat <a
        href="https://www.apple.com.cn"
        target="_blank"><u>apples</u> <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      > instead.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
